{"id":"86ad48bbd1843ed6","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-peano-arithmetic.md","title":"Peano Arithmetic","display":"df-peano-arithmetic — Peano Arithmetic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-peano-arithmetic","aliases":["89-df-peano-arithmetic","PA","Peano arithmetic"],"display":"df-peano-arithmetic — Peano Arithmetic","depends_on":["[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-peano-arithmetic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-peano-arithmetic</span><span>PA</span><span>Peano arithmetic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-peano-arithmetic — Peano Arithmetic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a257e5b1de6880b7\" href=\"?note=a257e5b1de6880b7\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-language\">89-df-arithmetical-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2e7227755a8473e0\" href=\"?note=2e7227755a8473e0\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus\">89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> 及避免捕获替换取算术语言原子。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm{PA}}=\\{v_i\\mid i\\in\\omega\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm{PA}}=\\{v_i\\mid i\\in\\omega\\}\\)</span>。对每对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar y(\\varphi,x)\">\\(\\bar y(\\varphi,x)\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\)</span> 按变元指标递增排列的有限列表。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\bar y(\\varphi,x)\">\\(\\forall\\bar y(\\varphi,x)\\)</span> 按该列表作全称闭合；空列表不加量词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> 是下面分别定义的六个递归公理集及归纳模式集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 是其并集。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>六个基本公理中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathsf V\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathsf V\\)</span> 为固定互异变量；归纳模式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 独立地遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf V\">\\(\\mathsf V\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}peano\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\coloneqq\\{&amp;\n\\forall x\\,Sx\\ne0,\\ \\forall x\\forall y(Sx=Sy\\to x=y),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x(x+0=x),\\ \\forall x\\forall y(x+Sy=S(x+y)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x(x\\times0=0),\\ \\forall x\\forall y(x\\times Sy=x\\times y+x)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\coloneqq\\{&amp;\n\\forall\\bar y(\\varphi,x)[(\\varphi[0/x]\\land\n\\forall x(\\varphi\\to\\varphi[Sx/x]))\\to\\forall x\\varphi]\n\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\n\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}peano\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\coloneqq\\{&amp;\n\\forall x\\,Sx\\ne0,\\ \\forall x\\forall y(Sx=Sy\\to x=y),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x(x+0=x),\\ \\forall x\\forall y(x+Sy=S(x+y)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x(x\\times0=0),\\ \\forall x\\forall y(x\\times Sy=x\\times y+x)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\coloneqq\\{&amp;\n\\forall\\bar y(\\varphi,x)[(\\varphi[0/x]\\land\n\\forall x(\\varphi\\to\\varphi[Sx/x]))\\to\\forall x\\varphi]\n\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\n\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bar y(\\varphi,x)\\coloneqq\\langle v_{s_j}\\mid j&lt;|s|\\rangle,\\quad s\\coloneqq\\operatorname{inc}(\\{i\\in\\omega\\mid v_i\\in\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bar y(\\varphi,x)\\coloneqq\\langle v_{s_j}\\mid j&lt;|s|\\rangle,\\quad s\\coloneqq\\operatorname{inc}(\\{i\\in\\omega\\mid v_i\\in\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 2 章，印刷页 15–20；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 表示公理集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}A\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}A\\)</span> 表示其经典演算可证性；二者不同。每个归纳实例分别绑定其归纳变元 x 与其余全部自由参数，故确为句子；不存在依赖一组固定参数而遗漏其他自由变元的实例。六个递归公理与全部归纳实例在标准结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 中为真。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-language","status":"resolved","id":"a257e5b1de6880b7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"2e7227755a8473e0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm{PA}}=\\{v_i\\mid i\\in\\omega\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar y(\\varphi,x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\bar y(\\varphi,x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in\\mathsf V","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}peano\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\coloneqq\\{&\n\\forall x\\,Sx\\ne0,\\ \\forall x\\forall y(Sx=Sy\\to x=y),\\\\\n&\\forall x(x+0=x),\\ \\forall x\\forall y(x+Sy=S(x+y)),\\\\\n&\\forall x(x\\times0=0),\\ \\forall x\\forall y(x\\times Sy=x\\times y+x)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\coloneqq\\{&\n\\forall\\bar y(\\varphi,x)[(\\varphi[0/x]\\land\n\\forall x(\\varphi\\to\\varphi[Sx/x]))\\to\\forall x\\varphi]\n\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\n\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\bar y(\\varphi,x)\\coloneqq\\langle v_{s_j}\\mid j<|s|\\rangle,\\quad s\\coloneqq\\operatorname{inc}(\\{i\\in\\omega\\mid v_i\\in\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false}],"bytes":2458,"backlinks":[{"id":"89cc8db92b5fad14","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"646431d492b9ae8a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0ce064881a79d6f7","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8c9363f0c1d91236","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}$ (see [[89-df-peano-arithmetic]])."},{"id":"2695165f0444a6d1","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8f382173effd5662","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"95d5a7c3d486f284","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"76cab88fafa3b379","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"571230a8af3bcd56","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1cc7f2e21119da30","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"02523cf5c9863d04","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5994c5401e3dcdfd","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8220f4203bbba1d2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e5cb4b74acf0f7a9","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"789ec4567d4c52bd","anchor":"r